    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/9/0/90825.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 14,
    "turn_text": "So when the Border Patrol agents in the middle of the night are on the border, and they come across a group of people like this that, you know, they're not gonna take in, is there any effort made to identify who the ringleaders are, who the guides are?",
